    <briefdescription>
<para>Static-method namespace for translating between engine <computeroutput><ref refid="class_matrix" kindref="compound">Matrix</ref></computeroutput> / <computeroutput>vec</computeroutput> polynomials and the F4-internal <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_g_b_f4_polynomial" kindref="compound">GBF4Polynomial</ref></computeroutput> form. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every method is <computeroutput>static</computeroutput> <mdash/> the class holds no state. It bundles the conversion glue (<computeroutput><ref refid="class_f4to_m2_interface_a92e198196bd612dc6c436f336c124d36_1a92e198196bd612dc6c436f336c124d36" kindref="member">poly_set_degrees</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="class_f4to_m2_interface_aeae8fb357cd440600883ddebdf7c11d4_1aeae8fb357cd440600883ddebdf7c11d4" kindref="member">to_M2_vec</ref></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ref refid="class_f4to_m2_interface_a033aaf936047f35de1074ebf222882b4_1a033aaf936047f35de1074ebf222882b4" kindref="member">from_M2_vec</ref></computeroutput>, matrix-wide variants) that <computeroutput><ref refid="class_f4_computation" kindref="compound">F4Computation</ref></computeroutput> uses when handing input to <computeroutput><ref refid="class_f4_g_b" kindref="compound">F4GB</ref></computeroutput> and reading its output back into the engine&apos;s <computeroutput><ref refid="class_matrix" kindref="compound">Matrix</ref></computeroutput> / <computeroutput><ref refid="class_mutable_matrix" kindref="compound">MutableMatrix</ref></computeroutput> types. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
